  <item>
    <title>搞文艺，我们都被打懵了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a1910163a61044f40dd89e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a1910163a61044f40dd89e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jul 2023 15:00:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们，你们好呀~本期我们就近期看过的爵士乐现场、电影、剧集、话剧聊个随缘龙门阵~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 第十期啦！主播有话说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 一起观看了电子爵士乐队演出，打懵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 看三宅唱导演的《惠子，凝视》，安吉拉哭了三次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 碧婷最近在看欲望都市续集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 贾科长又出来吆喝了，关于阿彼察邦导演的《记忆》的观感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 《白鹿原》和《惊梦》，两部话剧大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">54:40</a> 陈佩斯真的是大艺术家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4040">67:20</a> 接下来真的要停更一段时间，朋友们等我们归来！</span></p>]]></description>
