  <item>
    <title>她是“好小气”的陈绮贞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648ed3bb830480fdfa2dc99b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648ed3bb830480fdfa2dc99b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jun 2023 09:51:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们，你们好呀~这期我们聊聊对80后、90后文艺青年有深远影响的创作歌手——陈绮贞。陈绮贞与我们的青春记忆同在，借此机会，我们在回顾她的音乐作品、创作历程时也表达一下我们对陈绮贞近期新闻事件的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 故事从头说起，关于钟成虎的小作文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 陈绮贞的歌迷都知道她本来就是“小作精”呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 碧婷和安吉拉第一次听陈绮贞是什么时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 原来陈绮贞也是从魔岩出道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 感谢伍佰老师的慧眼识珠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a>“少女标本”的四个女孩，在华语娱乐圈都留下了痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 陈绮贞早期是体验派创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 重要的分水岭——《华丽的冒险》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 在商业和独立之间的选择与平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> 利益下，任何关系都很脆弱不堪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 后期专辑，大家都取向是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 版权纠纷到底是怎么回事？陈绮贞还可以唱哪些歌曲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 陈绮贞歌曲安利与收听tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>【陈绮贞相关作品推荐】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑：【精选1998-2005】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【华丽的冒险】</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌曲：【会不会】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【太聪明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【我的骄傲无可救药】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【情歌】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【漫漫长夜】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【self】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【女明星】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【流浪者之歌】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【鱼】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;【她说】</span></p><span></span><p><span>演唱会：【花的姿态】演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span>MV：【吉他手】【我喜欢上你时的内心活动】</span></p>]]></description>
