  <item>
    <title>都是为了华语电影，从永安镇到电影节</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6489dad6eedbb7b5edb33634</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6489dad6eedbb7b5edb33634</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 15:20:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我们就已经提前观看的《永安镇故事集》聊起，漫谈近期在院线和流媒体上观看的华语文艺片，与各位朋友们分享下我们作为老百姓观众但又是文艺爱好者的观影心得和一些闲聊体会。</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a>抢票《悲情城市》，文艺之神附体一击即中</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>《永安镇故事集》，三个部分，三种关系，一个内核</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 喜欢编剧康春雷，主打一个日常疯癫</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> 魏书钧可以拍一部完全的文艺创作者嘴炮电影</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a>《野马分鬃》看出了工伤</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a>《路边野餐》安吉拉看哭了，碧婷打开数次都没看不下去</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a>《贾想》，贾樟柯的文字真的好，无奖竞猜《风流一代》哪位男演员可以加入巧巧元宇宙？</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 聊聊对影展系电影的评价</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 老百姓观众对华语文艺片的接受程度？</span></p><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 成都有“艺术院线”的话会去支持吗？严肃吐槽下成都本地的峨眉电影院</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvLRaliBEMluSXjNpinvP5Jw6LE7.m4a" length="87079221" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvdDV5eWhTbEN1YkRQNEQ1aFFDTTlzVERWR3IucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
